#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:7
#: ed51ea50fdcc49baaa581866abd4419d
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "烧录固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:9
#: f40e69b1ec3643868dc8f111f5a5c798
msgid ""
"These instructions will show you how to download the latest firmware onto "
"the autopilot hardware that already has ArduPilot firmware installed. This "
"process will use the Mission Planner ground control station. See "
":ref:`common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards`."
msgstr ""
"这些说明将向您展示如何将最新固件下载到已安装 ArduPilot 固件的飞控硬件上。此过程将使用 Mission Planner 地面站。参见 "
":ref:`common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:11
#: 49a2850ea95f4a9c83e4637a3ed8cec6
msgid ""
"for some autopilots, it may be possible to update the firmware by "
":ref:`flashing from SD card <common-install-sdcard>`"
msgstr "对于某些飞控，可以通过 :ref:`从 SD 卡烧录 <common-install-sdcard>` 来更新固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:14
#: d368f52076604da19c67ae9a593204e4
msgid "Installation Steps"
msgstr "安装步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:16
#: 7a9baf3288bc4a4b832373f10a22e152
msgid "Connect autopilot to computer"
msgstr "将飞控连接到电脑"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:18
#: 9caf6e0ca1a64950945e157795b29610
msgid ""
"Once you have :ref:`installed a ground station <common-install-gcs>` on your"
" computer, connect the autopilot using a USB cable as shown below. Use a "
"direct USB port on your computer (not a USB hub)."
msgstr ""
"在电脑上 :ref:`安装地面站 <common-install-gcs>` 后，使用 USB 线缆按如下所示连接飞控。请使用电脑上的直连 USB "
"端口（不要使用 USB 集线器）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:26
#: a5dc491e5d3b4087b302abcf9c15bc4d
msgid "Pixhawk USB Connection"
msgstr "Pixhawk USB 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:28
#: 6a99dda6158f47c3b7ff006fb2ee9723
msgid ""
"Windows should automatically detect and install the correct driver software."
msgstr "Windows 应自动检测并安装正确的驱动程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:32
#: 52b25e64228840219f0526644ea0eecb
msgid "Select the COM port"
msgstr "选择 COM 端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:34
#: 7ec770b44102413b896c7eef3c164551
msgid ""
"If using *Mission Planner* as the GCS, select the COM port drop-down in the "
"upper-right corner of the window near the **Connect** button. Select "
"**AUTO** or the specific port for your board. Set the Baud rate to "
"**115200** as shown. Do not hit **Connect** just yet."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 *Mission Planner* 作为 GCS，在窗口右上角 **Connect** 按钮旁边的 COM 端口下拉菜单中选择端口。选择 "
"**AUTO** 或飞控板的特定端口。将波特率设置为 **115200**，如图所示。暂时不要按 **Connect**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:40
#: 73eaf8c3471b4f4c831ff7b5d73f3217
msgid "Install firmware"
msgstr "安装固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:42
#: 4a0fc282b42e49a08af397a8822c365d
msgid ""
"In Mission Planner's **SETUP \\| Install Firmware** screen select the "
"appropriate icon that matches your vehicle or frame type(i.e. Quad, Hexa). "
"Answer **Yes** when it asks you \"Are you sure?\"."
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 的 **设置 \\| 安装固件** 界面中，选择与您飞行器或机架类型匹配的图标（如四旋翼、六旋翼）。当询问 "
"「确定吗？」 时，回答 **是**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:49
#: c097dbff84d9484fba965658bfc03575
msgid "Mission Planner: Install FirmwareScreen"
msgstr "Mission Planner：安装固件界面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:51
#: 41d75609d39f4e1aa0b908b8054d65ef
msgid ""
"some boards are specifically targeted to a particular vehicle type and "
"firmware is not automatically built for other vehicles. However, ArduPilot "
"could still be built for those other vehicles using the `Custom Firmware "
"Server <https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__."
msgstr ""
"某些飞控板专门针对特定飞行器类型，不会自动为其他飞行器构建固件。但是，ArduPilot 仍然可以使用 `自定义固件服务器 "
"<https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__ 为这些其他飞行器构建。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:53
#: 38ac719e5c574e6e93ca9b668c9f48e2
msgid ""
"Mission Planner will try to detect which board you are using. It may ask you"
" to unplug the board, press OK, and plug it back in to detect the board "
"type."
msgstr "Mission Planner 将尝试检测您使用的飞控板。它可能会要求您拔出飞控板，按 OK，再插回以检测飞控板类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:58
#: 0384017a49dd4483b632908021ca404c
msgid "Mission Planner: Install Firmware Prompt"
msgstr "Mission Planner：安装固件提示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:60
#: 32e6287a567c43248c074b83a09e3961
msgid ""
"Often you will be presented with a dropdown box of firmware variants for the"
" board, which you can select from (such as bi-directional DShot variants, if"
" available). For boards which share the Pixhawk board id, the list will be "
"extensive, as shown below:"
msgstr ""
"通常会出现该飞控板固件变体的下拉框供您选择（如双向 DShot 变体，如果可用）。对于共享 Pixhawk 飞控板 ID "
"的飞控板，列表会很长，如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:65
#: 2e9a87e743db4407bf0db36e25b87a34
msgid ""
"Select the appropriate firmware for your board. For boards marked "
"\"Pixhawk\", Pixhawk1 firmware is usually the best choice."
msgstr "为您的飞控板选择合适的固件。对于标记为 「Pixhawk」 的飞控板，Pixhawk1 固件通常是最佳选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:67
#: b8061ec736114dd6868623ec4b7b4ae8
msgid ""
"some boards labeled as Pixhawk 2.4.x may have sensor substitutions which may"
" lead to pre-arm checks or no secondary IMU. Please see the BARO_OPTIONS "
"parameter for a workaround for a known sensor substitution on some boards of"
" a MS5607 barometer where a MS5611 should be used. IMUs may also be "
"substituted. Where possible, please source autopilots from ArduPilot "
"partners."
msgstr ""
"部分标记为 Pixhawk 2.4.x 的飞控板可能存在传感器替换，可能导致解锁前检查失败或没有辅助 IMU。对于某些已知的 MS5607 "
"气压计（应使用 MS5611）传感器替换问题，请参阅 BARO_OPTIONS 参数的解决方法。IMU 也可能被替换。请尽量从 ArduPilot "
"合作伙伴处购买飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:69
#: 3ec4e0d2fa2e495b92f0e0db5013aedc
msgid ""
"If all goes well, you will see a status appear on the bottom right including"
" the words: \"erase...\", \"program...\", \"verify..\", and \"Upload Done\"."
" The firmware has been successfully uploaded to the board."
msgstr ""
"如果一切顺利，屏幕右下角会显示状态，包括：「erase...」、「program...」、「verify..」 和 「Upload "
"Done」。固件已成功上传到飞控板。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:71
#: c57619a13540463297bc6b4821705fb0
msgid ""
"It usually takes a few seconds for the bootloader to exit and enter the main"
" code after programming or a power-up. Wait to press CONNECT until this "
"occurs."
msgstr "烧录或上电后，引导程序通常需要几秒钟才能退出并进入主代码。请等到此过程完成后再按 CONNECT。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:73
#: bc2dd0975a4143e5ad500123b0ba061b
msgid ""
"Updating the firmware to a newer version does not alter existing parameters "
"unless the firmware is for a different vehicle, in which case parameters are"
" reset to their default values for that vehicle. However, it is always a "
"good idea to save your parameters to a file using the \"Save to File\" "
"button on the Mission Planner's **CONFIG/Full Parameter Tree** tab before "
"any firmware updates, just in case of any issues while updating. Do not "
"apply all parameters after upgrading to a new version as some parameters "
"might have a different meaning."
msgstr ""
"将固件更新到新版本不会改变现有参数，除非固件适用于不同飞行器，在这种情况下参数将重置为该飞行器的默认值。但是，在任何固件更新前，始终建议使用 "
"Mission Planner **配置/完整参数树** 标签页上的 「保存到文件」 "
"按钮将参数保存到文件，以防更新时出现问题。升级到新版本后，请勿应用所有参数，因为某些参数可能含义不同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:76
#: 17bcc2394af4455c8da62aa45496fc4d
msgid "Using Beta, Developer, and Customized Versions"
msgstr "使用 Beta 版、开发者版和自定义版本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:79
#: ad6a1da3a5b94a72a15987957edc6f8f
msgid "Beta"
msgstr "Beta"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:81
#: 8af589051b5445c3b211a3397f662a99
msgid ""
"Prior to ``Stable`` releases, ``Beta`` versions are released. These may be "
"used if you wish to try newer features or help the developers flight test "
"new code. Since these are \"beta\" versions, there may still be bugs. This "
"is possible even in Stable release firmware. However, a Beta release has "
"been tested by the development team, and already flight tested. This release"
" allows a wider user base to final test the firmware before releasing as "
"``Stable``. Experienced ArduPilot users are encouraged to test fly this "
"firmware and provide feedback."
msgstr ""
"在 ``Stable`` 发布之前，会先发布 ``Beta`` "
"版本。如果您希望尝试新功能或帮助开发者飞行测试新代码，可以使用这些版本。由于是「测试版」，可能仍有缺陷。即使在 Stable 固件中也可能如此。但 "
"Beta 版本已经过开发团队测试并已飞行验证。此版本允许更广泛的用户群体对固件进行最终测试后再发布为 ``Stable``。鼓励有经验的 "
"ArduPilot 用户试飞该固件并提供反馈。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:83
#: 24c766a2334445a5af08e6ea9cfd813c
msgid ""
"Mission Planner has an option on the **Install Firmware** page to upload "
"this release, but later ``Stable`` releases may already be available. Be "
"sure to check the normal vehicle upload option first."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 在 **安装固件** 页面上有上传此版本的选项，但可能已有更新的 ``Stable`` "
"版本可用。请务必先检查正常的飞行器上传选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:86
#: 46dc76891a754308ba1cf7154dc46e62
msgid "Latest Developer Version"
msgstr "最新开发者版本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:88
#: 29048d667e4b4968953e71663526a288
msgid ""
"This reflects the current state of the development branch of the ArduPilot "
"code. It has been reviewed by the development team, passed all automated "
"test suites, and in most cases test flown. This code gets built daily and is"
" available for testing by experienced users. This corresponds to an "
"\"alpha\" release, and may have bugs, although very rarely \"crash "
"inducing\". Very shortly after an addition that changes or introduces a "
"feature is added, the :ref:`Upcoming Features <common-master-features>` "
"section of the Wiki is updated with information about the addition or "
"change."
msgstr ""
"这反映了 ArduPilot "
"代码开发分支的当前状态。已经过开发团队审查，通过了所有自动化测试套件，并且在大多数情况下已进行飞行测试。该代码每日构建，供有经验的用户测试。这相当于 "
"「alpha」 发布，可能存在缺陷，但很少会 「导致坠机」。在添加新功能或更改功能后不久，Wiki 的 :ref:`即将推出的功能 <common-"
"master-features>` 部分会更新相关信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:90
#: 04d975bbf4cf4b7fb22bd4791aab16ed
msgid ""
"This code must be manually downloaded from the `Firmware Downloads "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ page as ``latest`` for your particular "
"board, and then uploaded using Mission Planner's \"Load Custom Firmware\" "
"option on its **Install Firmware Page**"
msgstr ""
"该代码必须从 `固件下载 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ 页面以特定飞控板的 ``latest`` "
"版本手动下载，然后使用 Mission Planner **安装固件页面**上的 「加载自定义固件」 选项上传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:93
#: ff032461fa2c4769957b5bbc06c25e25
msgid "Custom Firmware Build Server"
msgstr "自定义固件构建服务器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:95
#: cc6f4f4c78b2407d82318cfd5a0739ff
msgid ""
"ArduPilot is currently experimentally testing a custom firmware build server"
" that will allow users to generate firmware builds for their autopilots with"
" selectable features. Since all 1MB flash sized boards now have feature "
"restrictions to allow the code to fit, this will give a path to enable a "
"user to select which features will or will not be included, giving some "
"flexibility to users of 1MB autopilots."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 目前正在试验性地测试一个自定义固件构建服务器，允许用户为其飞控生成可选功能的固件。由于所有 1MB "
"闪存大小的飞控板现在都有功能限制以适应代码大小，这将为用户提供一种途径，可以选择哪些功能包含或不包含，为 1MB 飞控用户提供一定的灵活性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:97
#: 92d945d208f94737a5151ec589dfe13f
msgid ""
"The server is located `HERE <https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__ and "
"instructions for its use are :ref:`on this page HERE <common-custom-"
"firmware>`."
msgstr ""
"服务器位于 `此处 <https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__，使用说明见 :ref:`此页面 <common-custom-"
"firmware>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:99
#: b32d26b66288447abe48977839d2b67c
msgid ""
"It allows creating a custom build, which can be downloaded, and flashed to "
"the autopilot using Mission Planner's \"Load Custom Firmware\" option on its"
" **Install Firmware Page**."
msgstr "它允许创建自定义构建，可以下载后使用 Mission Planner **安装固件页面**上的 「加载自定义固件」 选项烧录到飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:101
#: b4937277a8014ce780854f8f53c2606f
msgid "connect the ground station PC to the autopilot using a USB cable"
msgstr "使用 USB 线缆将地面站电脑连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:102
#: 64846f34d9d645448e2be3d91060ac00
msgid ""
"select the COM port and baud rate (normally 115200, but you can choose "
"higher if your hardware allows) for the board. These are selected on the top"
" right of the screen.  Do **not** press the Connect button"
msgstr ""
"选择飞控板的 COM 端口和波特率（通常为 115200，但如果硬件允许可选择更高值）。这些在屏幕右上角选择。**不要**按 Connect 按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:103
#: 49fc574e83524bdbb8f028c187179fa0
msgid "go to MP firmware install screen (select \"Setup >> Install Firmware\")"
msgstr "进入 MP 固件安装界面（选择 「设置 >> 安装固件」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:104
#: bd27f3129c844d4cbcd794ef059bc7e1
msgid ""
"click the \"Load custom firmware\" link and select the .apj file you "
"downloaded (do not select the .hex files, which are only meant to be used "
"with DFU/JTAG/SWD methods). If the \"Load custom firmware\" link is not "
"visible select \"Config >> Planner\" and set the \"Layout\" drop-down to "
"\"Advanced\"."
msgstr ""
"点击 「加载自定义固件」 链接并选择您下载的 .apj 文件（不要选择 .hex 文件，那些仅用于 DFU/JTAG/SWD 方法）。如果 "
"「加载自定义固件」 链接不可见，请选择 「配置 >> 规划器」 并将 「布局」 下拉菜单设为 「高级」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:105
#: c4b1d5f5e71c46878781dce738a20c0c
msgid ""
"you may need to click on \"Force bootloader\" before the step above "
"(assuming the board has been previously flashed with Ardupilot's bootloader)"
msgstr "在上述步骤之前，您可能需要点击 「强制引导程序」（假设飞控板之前已用 ArduPilot 的引导程序烧录）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:111
#: 3bffbf3529084d789d87574254f16632
msgid ""
"follow any instructions displayed regarding plugging/unplugging the board"
msgstr "按照屏幕上显示的关于插拔飞控板的任何说明操作"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:112
#: ffb02cce9fe94759bac8b27227bcf650
msgid ""
"if all goes well some status should be displayed at the bottom of the "
"screen.  i.e. \"erase...\", \"program...\", \"verify..\" and \"Upload "
"Done\"."
msgstr ""
"如果一切顺利，屏幕底部会显示一些状态信息，如 「erase...」、「program...」、「verify..」 和 「Upload Done」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:115
#: 27aa630898b649bf9b0e1298db8f08db
msgid "Firmware Limitations"
msgstr "固件限制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:117
#: 99f81e9f663d4c8485fa3fde3a7d3e40
msgid ""
"For a list of what features are **not** included in the current \"latest\" "
"firmware for any given autopilot, see :ref:`this page<binary-features>`."
msgstr "有关特定飞控当前 「最新」 固件中**未**包含的功能列表，请参阅 :ref:`此页面 <binary-features>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:118
#: f74b64c4ceba4c749ee3edf9928eba0d
msgid ""
"All the feature options currently **not** included in the 1MB autopilots, by"
" default, are on the list of options on the Custom Firmware Build Server. "
"There are also many features still included in the 1MB autopilots that may "
"not be required for your application. So it is possible to create a build "
"that includes some of the currently excluded features while removing some of"
" the unneeded features. The list of feature options will be continuously "
"expanded, allowing other large features to be dropped and more restricted "
"features added to the custom build. For example, not including QuadPlane "
"features will save space for Planes not requiring it. Drivers and peripheral"
" support may be individually selected, allowing only those used to be in the"
" code thus allowing other features to be included in the custom firmware."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，1MB 飞控中当前**未**包含的所有功能选项都在自定义固件构建服务器的选项列表中。1MB "
"飞控中仍包含的许多功能可能对您的应用来说不是必需的。因此，可以创建包含部分当前排除功能并移除部分不需要功能的构建。功能选项列表将持续扩展，允许删除其他大型功能并在自定义构建中添加更多受限功能。例如，不包含"
" QuadPlane 功能将为不需要它的 Plane 节省空间。驱动和外设支持可以单独选择，只保留实际使用的，从而允许在自定义固件中包含其他功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:119
#: 46b679b41e27468b91ec073b733c98d1
msgid ""
"Current build is from the daily master branch, Stable and Beta branches."
msgstr "当前构建来自每日 master 分支、Stable 和 Beta 分支。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:122
#: 0e0cf66e7b2c4788a7225d2f4f2cb06b
msgid "Loading Firmware via SD Card"
msgstr "通过 SD 卡烧录固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:124
#: 02698ab9e1f24f578e1ce5922beae812
msgid ""
"The firmware on some autopilots may be uploaded by copying an "
"'ardupilot.abin' firmware file to the SD card and then power cycling the "
"board.  Details on how to :ref:`update the firmware via SD Card can be found"
" here <common-install-sdcard>`."
msgstr ""
